h=c?"Official competitions (WCA)":"Thi \u0111\u1ea5u ch\xednh th\u1ee9c (WCA)"
g=c?"The World Cube Association (WCA) runs official competitions worldwide, including in Vietnam.":"World Cube Association (WCA) t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c c\xe1c gi\u1ea3i ch\xednh th\u1ee9c tr\xean kh\u1eafp th\u1ebf gi\u1edbi, k\u1ec3 c\u1ea3 \u1edf Vi\u1ec7t Nam."
