e7=$.c==="en"
e8=e7?"F2L 4: All four slots":"F2L 4: Ch\xe8n v\xe0o c\u1ea3 4 khe"
e9=e7?"Insert pairs into the left and back slots without rotating the whole cube.":"Ch\xe8n c\u1eb7p v\xe0o khe tr\xe1i v\xe0 khe sau m\xe0 kh\xf4ng c\u1ea7n xoay c\u1ea3 cube."
f0=e7?"Every front-right algorithm works for the other 3 slots by mirroring it.":'M\u1ecdi c\xf4ng th\u1ee9c khe tr\u01b0\u1edbc-ph\u1ea3i \u0111\u1ec1u d\xf9ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c cho 3 khe c\xf2n l\u1ea1i b\u1eb1ng c\xe1ch "soi g\u01b0\u01a1ng".'
f1=e7?"Front-left slot: swap R \u2194 L and reverse every turn. R U R' \u2192 L' U' L.":"Khe tr\u01b0\u1edbc-tr\xe1i: \u0111\u1ed5i R \u2194 L v\xe0 \u0111\u1ea3o chi\u1ec1u m\u1ecdi b\u01b0\u1edbc. R U R' \u2192 L' U' L."
f2=e7?"Back-right slot: keep R but reverse every turn. R U R' \u2192 R' U' R.":"Khe sau-ph\u1ea3i: gi\u1eef R nh\u01b0ng \u0111\u1ea3o chi\u1ec1u m\u1ecdi b\u01b0\u1edbc. R U R' \u2192 R' U' R."
f3=e7?"Back-left slot: mirror both ways. R U R' \u2192 L U L'.":"Khe sau-tr\xe1i: soi g\u01b0\u01a1ng c\u1ea3 hai l\u1ea7n. R U R' \u2192 L U L'."
f4=e7?"Rather not? Turn U to bring the pair to a front slot, or rotate y / y' \u2013 slower but fine.":"Kh\xf4ng mu\u1ed1n nh\u1edb? Xoay U \u0111\u1ec3 c\u1eb7p t\u1edbi khe tr\u01b0\u1edbc, ho\u1eb7c y / y' c\u1ea3 cube \u2013 ch\u1eadm h\u01a1n nh\u01b0ng v\u1eabn \u0111\xfang."
f0=A.a([f0,f1,f2,f3,f4,e7?"Practise: F2L practice \u2192 pick a slot (Front-left, Back-right, Back-left).":"Luy\u1ec7n: Luy\u1ec7n F2L \u2192 ch\u1ecdn khe (Tr\u01b0\u1edbc-tr\xe1i, Sau-ph\u1ea3i, Sau-tr\xe1i)."],s)
